Namanya [NAMA] [NAMA]. <segment id='1' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktvar' state='active'>Dia berasal dari <segment id='41' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kelebihan spasi' parent='1'>Tokyo.  Dia</segment> mahasiswa di Universitas Mirai Monozukuri. Dia belajar bahasa Jepang. Jepang sangat <segment id='3' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-adjektiva;adjafx' state='active' correction='menyenangkan' parent='1'>senang</segment>. 

Dia bangun tepat jam 12 tadi siang. Dia makan roti. Dia punya rokok. Dia melihat sepeda dan mobil. Dia tidak pergi ke Universitas Mirai Monozukuri. Dia agak <segment id='10' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-adjektiva;adjafx' state='active' correction='kedinginan' parent='1'>dingin</segment> dari jam 1 siang sampai jam 3 siang. Dia minum kopi.</segment>
Tepat jam 5 sore dia pergi ke <segment id='15' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi'>taman.<segment id='2' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktvar' state='active'>Dia</segment> melihat tiga <segment id='16' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi' parent='2'>kucing.Dia</segment> pulang dengan <segment id='22' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;det0' state='active' correction='tersebut' parent='2'>kucing pada</segment> jam 6 <segment id='23' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi' parent='2'>malam.Dia</segment> melihat <segment id='25' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi' parent='2'>SMP.Dia</segment> makan <segment id='28' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi' parent='2'>roti.Dia</segment> punya <segment id='29' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi' parent='2'>rokok.<segment id='8' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active' correction='HP-nya' parent='29'><segment id='7' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='HP' parent='8'>Hp</segment>nya</segment></segment> <segment id='30' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nya0' state='active' parent='2'>harga</segment> <segment id='31' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi' parent='2'><segment id='32' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active' correction='Pada' parent='31'>murah.Jam</segment></segment> 12 malam tidak ada yang melihatnya. <segment id='4' features='eror;leksikal;ungkapan;ukpa' state='active' parent='2'>Dia luang dua <segment id='34' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi' parent='2'>jam</segment>.<segment id='35' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrb0' state='active' correction='merasa' parent='2'>Dia</segment> paling</segment> sedih di <segment id='37' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi' parent='2'>dunia.Dia</segment> tidur jam 3 <segment id='40' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='malam' parent='2'>malan</segment>.</segment>    </body>
